espucio Oriente, Tramo Av. Príncipe de Gales -", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 11, "marginal": false}, {"i": 47, "pag": 1, "texto": "Los Presidentes\", a través del sistema de", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 11, "marginal": false}, {"i": 48, "pag": 1, "texto": "concesiones.", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 11, "marginal": false}, {"i": 49, "pag": 1, "texto": "- El Oficio Ord. N° 1401 de 27 de mayo de 2016, del", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 50, "pag": 1, "texto": "Señor Ministro de Hacienda, mediante el cual", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 51, "pag": 1, "texto": "aprueba las Bases de Licitación y el Prospecto de", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 52, "pag": 1, "texto": "Inversión del Proyecto denominado \"Concesión", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 53, "pag": 1, "texto": "Américo Vespucio Oriente, Tramo Av. Príncipe de", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 54, "pag": 1, "texto": "Gales - Los Presidentes\", a ejecutar por el sistema", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 55, "pag": 1, "texto": "de concesiones.", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 12, "marginal": false}, {"i": 56, "pag": 1, "texto": "REFRENDACION", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 13, "marginal": false}, {"i": 57, "pag": 1, "texto": "REF. POR $ ____________________", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 13, "marginal": false}, {"i": 58, "pag": 1, "texto": "IMPUTAC. ____________________", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 13, "marginal": false}, {"i": 59, "pag": 1, "texto": "ANOT. POR $ ____________________", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 13, "marginal": false}, {"i": 60, "pag": 1, "texto": "IMPUTAC. ____________________", "conf": null, "fuente": "vlm", "parrafo": 13, "marginal": false}, {"i": 61,